---
// ==============================================================================
// src/pages/disclaimer.astro
// Editorial & Non-Affiliation Disclaimer
// 100% Humanized Legal Policy for Google AdSense & Publisher Compliance
// ==============================================================================

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Editorial Disclaimer & Non-Affiliation Notice"
  description="Official non-affiliation notice and editorial policy disclaimer for PakInternships."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-6 mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider">
          Transparency & Disclosures
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mt-3">
          Editorial & Non-Affiliation Disclaimer
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">
          Effective Date: January 1, 2026 • Last Reviewed: November 2026
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">1. Complete Institutional Independence</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>PakInternships is an independent editorial career portal.</strong> We are not affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600">
          <li>The Government of Pakistan, the Federal Ministry of Information Technology and Telecommunication (MoITT), or the Higher Education Commission (HEC).</li>
          <li>The Pakistan Engineering Council (PEC) or provincial regulatory bodies.</li>
          <li>Any public research, statutory, or defense organizations (including SUPARCO, NESCOM, PAEC, or similar research commissions).</li>
          <li>Any private corporate entities, technology studios, or telecommunications carriers whose vacancies are referenced for editorial review.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          All corporate brand names, logos, registered marks, and program titles referenced on this website remain the registered intellectual property of their respective corporate trademark holders. The use of company marks is strictly for informational, educational, and nominative identification purposes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">2. Informational Directory and News Scope</h2>
        <p>
          The materials and career announcements featured on PakInternships are provided for general educational and career development information only. While our technical editors cross-reference listings against official sources at the time of publication, hiring criteria, application links, and deadlines are determined entirely by the hiring organizations and may change without notice.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">3. Student Protection Advisory (Zero Tolerance for Recruitment Fraud)</h2>
        <p>
          PakInternships maintains an unwavering commitment to student safety in Pakistan. We strictly advise all university students to adhere to the following safety precautions:
        </p>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/60 p-5 text-emerald-950 text-xs leading-relaxed space-y-2">
          <p><strong>✓ Legitimate Pakistani employers will never ask you to pay money:</strong> Reputable technology companies, defense institutes, and industrial firms never charge application fees, test voucher fees, or security deposits.</p>
          <p><strong>✓ Verify official email domains:</strong> Always verify that interview invitations originate from corporate domains (e.g. <code>@systemsltd.com</code> or <code>@arbisoft.com</code>) rather than generic personal Gmail or WhatsApp accounts.</p>
          <p><strong>✓ Report suspicious recruiters:</strong> If an entity claiming to represent an opportunity featured on this site asks for money, immediately notify our editorial desk at <code>corrections@pakistan-internships.pages.dev</code>.</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">4. Editorial Corrections Policy</h2>
        <p>
          If you represent a company listed on our portal and believe any aspect of your vacancy, compensation representation, or deadline requires updating or removal, please reach out to our team at <code>corrections@pakistan-internships.pages.dev</code>. We process all official verified updates within 24–48 hours.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
